        "claim": "Entropy weights and TOPSIS score Shaanxi's four land types at 0.00456, 0.02792, 0.27889, and 0.40678; awareness, market rules, and social monitoring then win the short, middle, and long horizons at the urban site, while crime rises 2.140 percent and accidents fall 2.135 percent.",
